### Lab 09: Modular MVC Architecture & Database Seeding
### Tested with VS Code REST Client

### 1. GET All Books via MVC Pipeline
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/books/
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Book by ID (ID 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST New Book via MVC Controller
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/books/
Content-Type: application/json

